      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BREAKN' A SWEAT (3) turned spotting a big start finishing fifth (24.93) last time in a Grade 5 at Sale. Solid record here at the distance winning two races. Should be very hard to beat this time. MIGHTY HERCULES (7) turned in a better effort at this track last start, finishing second behind Blazing Blue Ice (26.36) in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Will give a great sight again. MISS KARIS (6) has been hard to follow lately, running seventh (26.56) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at this track. This looks easier and expected to improve sharply. DELIGHTFUL RAIN (8) was out of the money at this circuit last start but can turn the form around.",
